| Buffer Name | Location | Type / Structure | Capacity / Limits | Eviction Policy |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| PTY Read Buffer | `src-tauri/src/terminal/session.rs:53` | `[u8; 4096]` stack slice | 4 KiB per read | Replaced every read cycle |
| PTY MPSC Channel | `src-tauri/src/terminal/pty.rs:136` | `mpsc::channel(1024)` | 1024 chunks | Bounded backpressure |
| Rust `BoundedBuffer` | `src-tauri/src/terminal/output_hub.rs:8-39` | `VecDeque<Vec<u8>>` | 512 KiB (`DEFAULT_BUFFER_CAPACITY`) | Head chunk eviction (`pop_front`) when `current_size > capacity` |
| Rust Broadcast Hub | `src-tauri/src/terminal/output_hub.rs:7, 50` | `tokio::sync::broadcast::channel(1024)` | 1024 messages | Lagged receivers receive `RecvError::Lagged` |
| Rust IPC Batch Buffer | `src-tauri/src/ipc/terminal.rs:19-20, 218` | `Vec<u8>` | 32 KiB or 10ms timer | Flushed and cleared on tick or overflow |
| Frontend Decoder Cache | `ui/src/lib/terminalOutput.ts:18` | `Map<string, TextDecoder>` | 1 instance per active session | Cleared on `clearSession(id)` |
| Frontend OSC Carry | `ui/src/lib/terminalEvents.ts:6, 79` | `Map<string, string>` | Up to 8 KiB (`MAX_OSC_TITLE_CHARS`) | Truncated / cleared on matched terminator |
| Frontend Session Backlog | `ui/src/lib/terminalEvents.ts:5, 14-17, 78` | `Map<string, { chunks: string[]; totalChars: number }>` | 512 KiB characters (`MAX_BACKLOG_CHARS`) | Slices/shifts oldest chunk when total length exceeds 512 KiB |

